  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Emergency and Critical Care Systems Strengthening Initiative (RECSI) (Asia-Pacific)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative aims to enhance local capacity to provide high-quality emergency and critical care in Timor-Leste, PNG, Fiji and the broader Pacific region. It will enhance workforce capacity and training, streamline systems and processes, elevate data and research capabilities, and advance leadership and governance standards. The initiative is delivered by a consortium of organisations, coordinated by Alfred Health.</narrative>
  </description>
